{"id":"u32","kelas":10,"no":6,"judul":"Pengumuman dan Undangan","title":"Announcements and Invitations","emoji":"📣","ringkas":"Teks fungsional pendek: pengumuman, undangan, dan pesan","ready":true,"goals":["memahami ciri **announcement** (pengumuman), **invitation** (undangan), dan **short message** (pesan pendek)","menemukan informasi penting: [[what]], [[when]], [[where]], [[who]], dan kontak","memakai ungkapan: [[We are pleased to announce ...]], [[You are invited to ...]], [[Please come ...]]","menerima dan menolak undangan dengan sopan","memakai [[will be held]], [[on + hari/tanggal]], [[at + jam/tempat]] dengan benar","menulis pengumuman, undangan, dan pesan pendek yang jelas"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Papan pengumuman sekolah, undangan ulang tahun di grup WhatsApp, pesan singkat dari guru: semuanya adalah **teks fungsional pendek**. Teks ini ditulis singkat, jelas, dan memuat **informasi penting** saja. Di kelas 9 kamu sudah mengenalnya. Sekarang kamu belajar membaca dan menulisnya dengan lebih lengkap."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Tiga jenis teks pendek","table":[["Jenis","Tujuan","Contoh"],["**Announcement**","memberi tahu informasi kepada banyak orang","[[The library will be closed on Friday.]]"],["**Invitation**","mengajak orang datang ke acara","[[You are invited to my birthday party.]]"],["**Short message**","menyampaikan pesan singkat kepada seseorang","[[Mom, I will be late. Don't wait for me.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Informasi yang harus ada","table":[["Informasi","Pertanyaan","Contoh"],["**What**","acara apa?","[[English Speech Contest]]"],["**When**","kapan?","[[on Saturday, 15 March, at 9 a.m.]]"],["**Where**","di mana?","[[in the school hall]]"],["**Who**","untuk/siapa?","[[for all students of Grade 10]]"],["**Contact / RSVP**","konfirmasi ke siapa?","[[Please call Ms. Sari at 0812-3456-7890.]]"]]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Kosakata penting","items":[{"en":"announce","id":"mengumumkan","ex":"The school announces a new schedule."},{"en":"invite","id":"mengundang","ex":"I invite you to my party."},{"en":"event","id":"acara","ex":"The event starts at nine."},{"en":"attend","id":"menghadiri","ex":"All students must attend the meeting."},{"en":"be held","id":"diadakan","ex":"The meeting will be held in the hall."},{"en":"venue","id":"tempat acara","ex":"The venue is the school field."},{"en":"bring","id":"membawa","ex":"Please bring your own water bottle."},{"en":"register","id":"mendaftar","ex":"Register before Friday."},{"en":"deadline","id":"batas waktu","ex":"The deadline is Monday."},{"en":"cancel","id":"membatalkan","ex":"The match was cancelled because of rain."},{"en":"postpone","id":"menunda","ex":"The picnic is postponed until next week."},{"en":"RSVP","id":"mohon konfirmasi kehadiran","ex":"RSVP to Dina by Thursday."},{"en":"lost and found","id":"barang hilang dan ditemukan","ex":"Check the lost and found box."},{"en":"dress code","id":"aturan berpakaian","ex":"The dress code is batik."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Ungkapan yang sering dipakai","table":[["Fungsi","Ungkapan","Contoh"],["Mengumumkan","[[We are pleased to announce that ...]]","[[We are pleased to announce that the contest will be held on Friday.]]"],["Mengundang","[[You are invited to ...]]","[[You are invited to our school anniversary.]]"],["Mengajak","[[Please come / join us ...]]","[[Please join us at the field.]]"],["Mengingatkan","[[Don't forget to ...]]","[[Don't forget to bring your ID card.]]"],["Membatalkan","[[... has been cancelled.]]","[[The class has been cancelled.]]"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Preposisi waktu dan tempat","text":"Pakai [[on]] untuk hari dan tanggal ([[on Monday]], [[on 5 May]]), [[at]] untuk jam dan tempat spesifik ([[at 8 a.m.]], [[at the school hall]]), dan [[in]] untuk bulan, tahun, atau ruangan ([[in June]], [[in Room 5]])."},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Menerima dan menolak undangan","table":[["Fungsi","Contoh"],["Menerima","[[Thank you for inviting me. I would love to come.]] / [[Sure, I'll be there.]]"],["Menolak sopan","[[Thank you for inviting me, but I'm afraid I can't come.]]"],["Memberi alasan","[[I have a family event that day.]]"],["Berharap","[[I hope the party goes well.]]"]]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Teks 1: Pengumuman Sekolah","lines":[{"who":"Announcement","en":"ANNOUNCEMENT. English Speech Contest","id":"PENGUMUMAN. Lomba Pidato Bahasa Inggris"},{"who":"Announcement","en":"We are pleased to announce that an English Speech Contest will be held on Saturday, 15 March, at 9 a.m. in the school hall.","id":"Dengan senang hati kami mengumumkan bahwa Lomba Pidato Bahasa Inggris akan diadakan pada hari Sabtu, 15 Maret, pukul 9 pagi di aula sekolah."},{"who":"Announcement","en":"The contest is open to all students of Grade 10. Please register to Ms. Sari before Wednesday.","id":"Lomba terbuka untuk semua siswa kelas 10. Silakan mendaftar kepada Ms. Sari sebelum hari Rabu."},{"who":"Announcement","en":"Don't forget to bring your student card.","id":"Jangan lupa membawa kartu pelajar."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Teks 2: Undangan Ulang Tahun","lines":[{"who":"Invitation","en":"You are invited to Rani's 16th birthday party!","id":"Kamu diundang ke pesta ulang tahun ke-16 Rani!"},{"who":"Invitation","en":"Date: Sunday, 23 June. Time: 4 p.m. Place: Rani's house, 12 Melati Street.","id":"Tanggal: Minggu, 23 Juni. Waktu: pukul 4 sore. Tempat: rumah Rani, Jalan Melati 12."},{"who":"Invitation","en":"Please wear something blue. There will be food, games, and music.","id":"Mohon kenakan sesuatu berwarna biru. Akan ada makanan, permainan, dan musik."},{"who":"Invitation","en":"RSVP to Rani by Thursday. See you there!","id":"Konfirmasi ke Rani sebelum hari Kamis. Sampai jumpa di sana!"}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Teks 3: Pesan Pendek","lines":[{"who":"Mother","en":"Budi, I went to the market. Lunch is in the fridge. Please heat it before you eat. Don't forget to feed the cat. I'll be back at 3 p.m.","id":"Budi, Ibu pergi ke pasar. Makan siang ada di kulkas. Tolong panaskan sebelum makan. Jangan lupa memberi makan kucing. Ibu pulang pukul 3 sore."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Menjawab undangan","lines":[{"who":"Dina","en":"Tom, I'm having a small party on Sunday at four. Can you come?","id":"Tom, aku mengadakan pesta kecil hari Minggu pukul empat. Bisa datang?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"Thank you for inviting me, Dina. I would love to come, but I'm afraid I have a football match that day.","id":"Terima kasih sudah mengundangku, Dina. Aku ingin sekali datang, tetapi sayangnya aku ada pertandingan sepak bola hari itu."},{"who":"Dina","en":"That's okay. Good luck with your match!","id":"Tidak apa-apa. Semoga berhasil di pertandinganmu!"},{"who":"Tom","en":"Thanks. I hope the party goes well.","id":"Terima kasih. Semoga pestanya lancar."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Membaca teks pendek dengan cepat","text":"Cari dulu **kata kunci**: hari, tanggal, jam, tempat, dan nomor telepon. Setelah itu baca perintah seperti [[Please bring ...]], [[Don't forget ...]], dan [[RSVP ...]]. Menulis pun begitu: mulai dari informasi yang paling penting."},{"t":"summary","items":["Tiga jenis: **announcement**, **invitation**, **short message**.","Informasi penting: **what, when, where, who**, dan kontak.","Ungkapan: [[We are pleased to announce ...]], [[You are invited to ...]], [[Don't forget to ...]].","[[on]] untuk hari/tanggal, [[at]] untuk jam/tempat, [[in]] untuk bulan/ruangan.","Menolak undangan: [[Thank you for inviting me, but I'm afraid I can't come.]]"]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["announce","mengumumkan"],["invite","mengundang"],["attend","menghadiri"],["register","mendaftar"],["deadline","batas waktu"]],"exp":"Kosakata dasar teks pengumuman dan undangan.","k":"db56a063"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["cancel","membatalkan"],["postpone","menunda"],["venue","tempat acara"],["event","acara"]],"exp":"Kosakata perubahan acara.","k":"48e19a70"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Teks yang memberi tahu informasi kepada banyak orang adalah...","options":["announcement","invitation","short message","recipe"],"answer":0,"exp":"Announcement = pengumuman.","k":"0b163b9c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Teks yang mengajak orang datang ke acara adalah...","options":["announcement","invitation","diary","report"],"answer":1,"exp":"Invitation = undangan.","k":"b762a9ca"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Informasi \"Saturday, 15 March, at 9 a.m.\" menjawab pertanyaan...","options":["Where?","Who?","When?","What?"],"answer":2,"exp":"Hari, tanggal, dan jam menjawab When.","k":"beedf5a7"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Informasi \"in the school hall\" menjawab pertanyaan...","options":["Where?","When?","Who?","Why?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Tempat menjawab Where.","k":"118bf14c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Preposisi yang tepat: \"The meeting is ___ Monday.\"","options":["on","at","in","to"],"answer":0,"exp":"on dipakai untuk hari.","k":"43d98193"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Preposisi yang tepat: \"The party starts ___ 4 p.m.\"","options":["on","at","in","by"],"answer":1,"exp":"at dipakai untuk jam.","k":"272474fe"},{"type":"fill","id":"Lomba akan diadakan pada hari Jumat.","q":"The contest will ___ held on Friday.","answers":["be"],"hint":"will + ?","exp":"will be held = akan diadakan.","k":"13d3c7ef"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kamu diundang ke pestaku.","q":"You ___ invited to my party.","answers":["are"],"hint":"are / is ?","exp":"You are invited = kamu diundang.","k":"eea6421e"},{"type":"fill","id":"Jangan lupa membawa kartu pelajar.","q":"Don't ___ to bring your student card.","answers":["forget"],"hint":"lupa","exp":"Don't forget to + kata kerja dasar.","k":"82d9d5b3"},{"type":"fill","id":"Silakan daftar sebelum hari Rabu.","q":"Please register ___ Wednesday.","answers":["before","by"],"hint":"sebelum","exp":"before / by = sebelum.","k":"a2884fb8"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kelas dibatalkan karena hujan.","q":"The class has been ___ because of the rain. (cancel)","answers":["cancelled","canceled"],"hint":"bentuk lampau","exp":"has been + V3.","k":"3ad2f1c9"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Pertemuan akan diadakan di aula.\"","answer":"The meeting will be held in the hall.","exp":"will be held + tempat.","k":"e4727e13"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Tolong bawa buku catatanmu.\"","answer":"Please bring your notebook.","exp":"Please + kata kerja dasar.","k":"22b316df"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Terima kasih sudah mengundangku.\"","answer":"Thank you for inviting me.","exp":"Thank you for + V-ing.","k":"b23879eb"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara sopan menolak undangan adalah...","options":["No, I don't want to.","Thank you for inviting me, but I'm afraid I can't come.","I never go to parties.","Don't invite me."],"answer":1,"exp":"Ucapkan terima kasih, lalu beri alasan.","k":"97a4e188"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"You are invited to my birthday party","options":["Kamu diundang ke pesta ulang tahunku","Kamu lupa pesta ulang tahunku","Pesta ulang tahunku dibatalkan","Aku datang ke pestamu"],"answer":0,"exp":"You are invited to = kamu diundang ke.","k":"42e7e2f5"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"The meeting has been postponed until next week","options":["Pertemuan ditunda sampai minggu depan","Pertemuan dimulai hari ini","Pertemuan sudah selesai","Pertemuan dibatalkan selamanya"],"answer":0,"exp":"postponed = ditunda.","k":"d5360df4"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Don't forget to bring your ID card","options":["Jangan lupa membawa kartu identitasmu","Jangan hilangkan kartu identitasmu","Tinggalkan kartu identitasmu","Belilah kartu identitas baru"],"answer":0,"exp":"Don't forget to = jangan lupa untuk.","k":"14f55bd8"},{"type":"fill","id":"Perpustakaan akan tutup hari Jumat.","q":"The library will be ___ on Friday. (close)","answers":["closed"],"hint":"will be + V3","exp":"will be closed = akan tutup.","k":"54f45b35"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kami dengan senang hati mengumumkan hasil lomba.","q":"We are ___ to announce the results.","answers":["pleased"],"hint":"senang","exp":"We are pleased to announce = kami dengan senang hati mengumumkan.","k":"c7c56c93"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pertemuan diadakan pada bulan Juni.","q":"The meeting is ___ June.","answers":["in"],"hint":"bulan","exp":"in + bulan.","k":"b02dcae7"},{"type":"fill","id":"Rapat diadakan di Ruang 5.","q":"The meeting is ___ Room 5.","answers":["in"],"hint":"ruangan","exp":"in + ruangan.","k":"1183120d"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tolong hubungi Ms. Sari.","q":"Please ___ Ms. Sari. (call)","answers":["call","contact"],"hint":"kata kerja dasar","exp":"Please + kata kerja dasar.","k":"260fd8e2"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku akan pulang terlambat.","q":"I will ___ late. (be)","answers":["be"],"hint":"will + ?","exp":"will be late = akan terlambat.","k":"e9d61f7e"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya ingin sekali datang.","q":"I would ___ to come.","answers":["love","like"],"hint":"ingin","exp":"would love to = ingin sekali.","k":"c2e27910"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku harap pestanya lancar.","q":"I ___ the party goes well.","answers":["hope"],"hint":"berharap","exp":"I hope = aku harap.","k":"0592db64"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pesta ditunda sampai minggu depan.","q":"The party is ___ until next week. (postpone)","answers":["postponed"],"hint":"V3","exp":"is postponed = ditunda.","k":"994969ef"},{"type":"fill","id":"Cek kotak barang hilang.","q":"Check the lost and ___ box.","answers":["found"],"hint":"hilang dan ...","exp":"lost and found = barang hilang dan ditemukan.","k":"1479d4b8"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pesan: \"Dina, I'm at the library. Come at 4. Bring the book.\" Dina harus membawa...","options":["buku","kotak makan","uang","payung"],"answer":0,"exp":"Bring the book = bawa bukunya.","k":"57b57115"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pengumuman: \"The school gate will close at 7 a.m.\" Artinya...","options":["gerbang sekolah ditutup pukul 7 pagi","gerbang dibuka pukul 7 malam","sekolah libur","gerbang rusak"],"answer":0,"exp":"close = tutup.","k":"ddc343ab"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Undangan: \"Dress code: batik.\" Artinya tamu harus memakai...","options":["pakaian batik","baju olahraga","seragam sekolah","pakaian hitam"],"answer":0,"exp":"Dress code = aturan berpakaian.","k":"d9ec976b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang berisi pengingat?","options":["Don't forget to bring your umbrella.","The match is on Friday.","Thank you for coming.","The hall is big."],"answer":0,"exp":"Don't forget to = pengingat.","k":"799b8835"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata yang tepat: \"The contest is open ___ all students.\"","options":["to","at","on","by"],"answer":0,"exp":"open to = terbuka untuk.","k":"3f7dc631"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Teks mana yang paling cocok ditempel di papan pengumuman?","options":["Lost: a blue bag. Please contact Ahmad in Class 10A.","Dear Diary, today I was happy.","Mix the eggs and the sugar.","Once upon a time, a king lived here."],"answer":0,"exp":"Pengumuman memuat informasi singkat dan kontak.","k":"819894c5"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang paling sopan untuk menerima undangan?","options":["Thank you for inviting me. I would love to come.","Okay.","Maybe I come.","I don't know."],"answer":0,"exp":"Terima kasih dan ungkapkan keinginan datang.","k":"55f16d53"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"The party will start at 4 p.m. and finish at 7 p.m.\" Pesta berlangsung selama...","options":["tiga jam","empat jam","tujuh jam","satu jam"],"answer":0,"exp":"4 sampai 7 = tiga jam.","k":"08b22ffc"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang memakai preposisi dengan benar?","options":["The class starts at 8 a.m. on Monday.","The class starts on 8 a.m. at Monday.","The class starts in 8 a.m. in Monday.","The class starts at 8 a.m. in Monday."],"answer":0,"exp":"at untuk jam, on untuk hari.","k":"f3e0df19"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Silakan datang ke lapangan sekolah.\"","answer":"Please come to the school field.","exp":"Please + kata kerja dasar + tempat.","k":"7b5aef72"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Kelas telah dibatalkan.\"","answer":"The class has been cancelled.","exp":"has been + V3.","k":"3b3e2314"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan ungkapan dengan fungsinya:","pairs":[["You are invited to ...","mengundang"],["Don't forget to ...","mengingatkan"],["... has been cancelled.","membatalkan"],["I'm afraid I can't come.","menolak"]],"exp":"Setiap ungkapan punya fungsi.","k":"241c79d1"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"The contest will be held in the school hall","options":["Lomba akan diadakan di aula sekolah","Lomba sudah selesai","Lomba dibatalkan","Aula sekolah sedang dibangun"],"answer":0,"exp":"will be held = akan diadakan.","k":"a0ec65b0"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Please call me if you are late","options":["Tolong telepon aku jika kamu terlambat","Jangan telepon aku","Aku terlambat hari ini","Kamu pasti datang tepat waktu"],"answer":0,"exp":"if = jika.","k":"ba8da517"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"I will be home at three","options":["Aku akan di rumah pukul tiga","Aku sudah pulang kemarin","Aku pergi pukul tiga","Rumahku ada tiga"],"answer":0,"exp":"will be home = akan di rumah.","k":"09f53a15"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kami mengundang Anda ke pesta ulang tahun.","q":"We ___ you to the birthday party.","answers":["invite"],"hint":"mengundang","exp":"invite.","k":"bce6f7ec"},{"type":"fill","id":"Acara dimulai pukul sembilan.","q":"The event ___ at nine o'clock. (start)","answers":["starts"],"hint":"it + s","exp":"starts.","k":"88b4e0e6"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mohon konfirmasi kehadiran Anda.","q":"Please ___ your attendance.","answers":["confirm"],"hint":"mengonfirmasi","exp":"confirm.","k":"383dffa1"},{"type":"fill","id":"Acara akan diadakan di aula sekolah.","q":"The event will be ___ in the school hall.","answers":["held"],"hint":"diadakan","exp":"be held.","k":"b05d4a67"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pertemuan ditunda sampai minggu depan.","q":"The meeting is ___ until next week.","answers":["postponed"],"hin